      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A 35-year-old primigravida presented with abdominal pain and urine retention due to an incarcerated uterus. The diagnosis was based on clinical symptoms, ultrasound and MRI. At a gestational age of 34 weeks and 3 days the patient delivered by caesarean section."},
